g\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:;\">\n          Giải thưởng\n      </li> <li aria-label=\"ROG Raikiri II Xbox Wireless Controller Video review\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-video\" id=\"Video_review\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:;\">\n          Video review\n      </li> <li aria-label=\"ROG Raikiri II Xbox Wireless Controller Media review\" role=\"tab\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-controls=\"tabpanel-media\" id=\"Media_review\" class=\"awardItem ProductAwards__awardTab__yaTHJ\" style=\"display:;\">\n          Media review\n      </li></ul></div> <div id=\"tabpanel-awards\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"Giải_thưởng\"><div class=\"ProductAward__productAwardPagePadding__dSaZj\"><div class=\"ProductAward__awardTitle__GUset\"><h2 class=\"pageAward vnRogFont ProductAward__vnRogFontSize__5eSiT\">\n        Giải thưởng \n      </h2> <span>(26)</span></div> <div class=\"ProductAward__mobileAwardContent__LNDCh\"><ul class=\"ProductAward__rewardContainer__sHbkR\" style=\"width:100%;\"><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1339/202402270018177600888.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"TechRadar Recommends\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      tech radar\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>TechRadar Recommends</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The Asus ROG Raikiri II Xbox Wireless is impressive on almost every front. With its 1000Hz polling rate and 3.5ms input latency, it’s lightning fast, while its TMR thumbsticks and triggers are unerringly precise. Both its build and subtle, sleek design earn my admiration and the level of customizability is fantastic. Really my only gripe is the lack of compatibility for its Gear Link software on Xbox, making switching profiles or tweaking sensitivities unnecessarily awkward for console gamers.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>UNITED KINGDOM</span> <span>02/27/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Raikiri II Xbox Wireless Controller Media review Award of TechRadar Recommends\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.techradar.com/gaming/gaming-accessories/asus-rog-raikiri-ii-review\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1332/202407121733401420433.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"7.6 out of 10\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Bestreviews.sg\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>7.6 out of 10</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      PC is where the Raikiri Pro shines. The 2.4Ghz dongle feels as quick as wired in shooters and racers, even in  busy wireless environments.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>SINGAPORE</span> <span>10/21/2025</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Raikiri II Xbox Wireless Controller Media review Award of 7.6 out of 10\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.bestreviews.sg/asus-rog-raikiri-pro-controller/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1265/202602132337557490218.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Hardware zoom: 93%\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Hardwarezoom\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Hardware zoom: 93%</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      With the Raikiri II, ASUS ROG delivers a high-end controller that is uncompromisingly tuned for performance.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>02/12/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Raikiri II Xbox Wireless Controller Media review Award of Hardware zoom: 93%\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.hardwarezoom.net/artikel/ASUS_ROG_Raikiri_II_Test_Review-59963\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1265/202602181635480060794.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Basic Tutorials: Gold Award\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      basic-tutorials.de\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Basic Tutorials: Gold Award</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Extremely high-quality, versatile professional controller for PC and Xbox. \n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>02/03/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Raikiri II Xbox Wireless Controller Media review Award of Basic Tutorials: Gold Award\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://basic-tutorials.de/tests/peripherie/asus-rog-raikiri-ii-test/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1265/202601262204482150853.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Hardwareinside: Top-class recommendation\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      hardwareinside.de\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Hardwareinside: Top-class recommendation</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The ASUS ROG Raikiri II Xbox Wireless is an unrivalled pro controller with clear gaming DNA.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>01/26/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Raikiri II Xbox Wireless Controller Media review Award of Hardwareinside: Top-class recommendation\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.hardwareinside.de/asus-rog-raikiri-ii-xbox-wireless-im-test-99367/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1263/202605281846297630772.PNG\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"8 out of 10\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      La Revue Geek\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>8 out of 10</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      With its impeccable build quality, virtually indestructible interchangeable joysticks and a software suite that lets you customise every setting, Asus has produced one of the best ‘Pro’ controllers on the market.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>FRANCE</span> <span>04/18/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Raikiri II Xbox Wireless Controller Media review Award of 8 out of 10\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.larevuegeek.com/tests/test-de-la-manette-asus-rog-raikiri-ii-l-arme-ultime-pour-pc-et-xbox-test144186\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1263/202203072144527310010.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"9 out of 10\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      TomsHardware\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>9 out of 10</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The integration of anti-drift TMR joysticks and micro-switches offers surgical responsiveness and precision that will delight demanding competitive gamers. The click sensation, similar to that of a mouse, and the inclusion of a charging station that guarantees virtually “unlimited” battery life are real assets that partly justify its high-end positioning.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>FRANCE</span> <span>01/27/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Raikiri II Xbox Wireless Controller Media review Award of 9 out of 10\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.tomshardware.fr/test-asus-rog-raikiri-ii-xbox-wireless-une-manette-performante-pour-joueurs-exigeants/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1263/202109281554230420862.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"8.5 out of 10\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      GameWave\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>8.5 out of 10</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The ROG Raikiri II is a solid and versatile premium controller. [...] The dual-mode triggers offer welcome flexibility, suitable for both demanding FPS games and games requiring precise analog actions. The comfortable grip, careful ergonomics, extensive use of micro-switches, and the comprehensive bundle convey a sense of quality and durability.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>FRANCE</span> <span>01/23/2026</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG Raikiri II Xbox Wireless Controller Media review Award of 8.5 out of 10\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://gamewave.fr/tests/asus-rog-raikiri-ii-test-de-la-manette-sans-fil-xbox-a-joysticks-tmr/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li></ul></div> <!----></div> <div class=\"ProductAward__rewardMoreButton__NCAU7\"><div class=\"seeAllButton__seeAllB